# Rib width against index and lateral size.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy. Bounds: index of the thin slab and of the full slab.
title Silicon rib 700 nm wide on a 90 nm slab
grid dx=0.025 dy=0.01
window width=4.0 ymin=-1.0 ymax=1.22
layer si 0 0.09
rect si -0.35 0.35 0 0.22
symmetry even
field te
expect neff 2.690847792 2e-8
expect group_index 3.844005626 2e-6
expect confinement 0.772074362 1e-6
expect area 0.187060171 1e-5
expect rms_x 0.179534699 1e-6
expect guided yes
expect cells 17760
expect neff_between 2.103273 2.847782
